      "body": "Confirming Bug 2 also reproduces on Linux — not Windows-specific.\n\n**Environment:**\n- Ubuntu 22.04\n- clang 14.0.0\n- Python 3.10.12 (via venv, no conda)\n- BitNet at HEAD with submodule llama.cpp at `1f86f058`\n\n**Error:** identical to the one in this issue, line 811 in `src/ggml-bitnet-mad.cpp`. The same one-line patch (`int8_t * y_col` → `const int8_t * y_col`) fixes it cleanly.\n\nThere are already several open PRs with exactly this fix sitting unreviewed: #418, #426, #465, #539. Merging any one of them would unblock builds for everyone.\n\n(Bug 1 is Windows-specific; only Bug 2 hit me.)",
